SUMMARY:[Hike - Beginner] Heber Down
DESCRIPTION:GTA Hiking & Stuff\nHeber Down Conservation is a great spot fo
 r a beginner Hike.\n\nThis is a beginner/intermediate hike. We will stick 
 to mostly flat and paved sections\, although we will be going into the bac
 k trails where there could be mud. We will cover about 8km.\n\n**THIS HIKE
  STARTS AT 9:30AM**\n\nBring a water bottle and dress for the weather.\n\n
 Parts of the trail can get muddy. Be prepared.\n\nWe are going to meet at 
 the Old Cullen Gardens. Intersection Cochrane & Taunton.\n\nGo to the back
  of the parking lot near the new Pickleball courts. The path starts to the
  left of the picnic shelter.\n\n**Hike leaves promptly at 9:35AM**\n\n**LE
 GAL DISCLAIMER AND LIABILITY INFORMATION:**\n\nBy RSVP'ing and paying the 
 event fee (if applicable)\, you are confirming that you have read\, unders
 tand and accept the following:\n\n1. **GTA Hiking Meetup is a private grou
