SUMMARY:Fall Hike at Secord Pond
DESCRIPTION:GTA Hiking & Stuff\nJoin us for a fall hike at Secord Pond. We
  will enjoy the fall colours and the scenic trail around Secord Pond and v
 isit the famous Pet Cemetery. The hike distance will be +/- 7km at a moder
 ate pace. If we have time\, we will explore some abandoned buildings.\n\nS
 ecord Pond is a hidden jem in the Durham network of trails. Come out and e
 njoy the morning.\n\nFor those who are interested\, we can do lunch at Ann
 ina's in the hamlet of Greenwood (where they filmed Schitts Creek). Great 
 food.\n\nAnnina's 300 Durham Regional Hwy 47\, Goodwood\, ON L0C 1A0\n\n**
 Note**\n- The hike will leave on time.\n- Know your limit\, hike within it
 .\n- Parking is free.\n- No dogs.\n- Dress according to the weather.\n- Be
  aware of ticks and tick prevention.\n- Pack water/snacks.\n- The hike wil
 l be posted "Canceled" if the weather doesn't cooperate.\n\nTo participate
  in this hike\, you and guests need to adhere to the rules and agree by a 
 reply of **"Yes"** to the liability\n\n**LEGAL DISCLAIMER AND LIABILITY IN
